## STOREFRONT RESULT PAGE RENDERING

```typescript
// app/services/results.server.ts — getResultPageData()
export async function getResultPageData(
  shop: string,
  quizId: string,
  completion: QuizCompletion
) {
  const match = await selectResultPage(quizId, completion);
  if (!match) return null;

  const { resultPage } = match;

  // Get recommended products
  const { getRecommendations } = await import("./recommendation.server");
  const products = await getRecommendations(shop, quizId, completion.tags, resultPage.productLimit);

  // Parse styling
  let styling: Record<string, string> = {};
  try { styling = JSON.parse(resultPage.styling); } catch {}

  return {
    resultPage: {
      id: resultPage.id,
      title: resultPage.title,
      description: resultPage.description,
      layout: resultPage.layout as "grid" | "list" | "carousel",
      showDiscount: resultPage.showDiscount,
      ctaText: resultPage.ctaText,
      styling,
    },
    products,
  };
}
```

---

## STOREFRONT WIDGET RESULT RENDERING

```javascript
// Result page HTML generation for the storefront widget
function renderResultPage(container, resultData) {
  const { resultPage, products } = resultData;
  const { layout, title, description, ctaText, showDiscount, styling } = resultPage;

  const primaryColor = styling.primaryColor || '#5C6AC4';

  let productsHTML = '';
  if (layout === 'grid') {
    productsHTML = `<div class="qs-products-grid">${products.map(p => renderProductCard(p, ctaText, primaryColor)).join('')}</div>`;
  } else if (layout === 'list') {
    productsHTML = `<div class="qs-products-list">${products.map(p => renderProductList(p, ctaText, primaryColor)).join('')}</div>`;
  } else if (layout === 'carousel') {
    productsHTML = `<div class="qs-products-carousel" data-carousel="true">${products.map(p => renderProductCard(p, ctaText, primaryColor)).join('')}</div>`;
  }

  container.innerHTML = `
    <div class="qs-result-page">
      <div class="qs-result-header">
        <h2 class="qs-result-title">${escapeHtml(title)}</h2>
        ${description ? `<p class="qs-result-description">${escapeHtml(description)}</p>` : ''}
      </div>
      ${productsHTML}
      ${showDiscount ? `<div class="qs-discount-reveal" id="qs-discount-reveal"></div>` : ''}
    </div>
  `;

  // Init carousel if needed
  if (layout === 'carousel') initCarousel(container.querySelector('[data-carousel]'));
}

function renderProductCard(product, ctaText, primaryColor) {
  const price = product.priceMin === product.priceMax
    ? `$${product.priceMin.toFixed(2)}`
    : `$${product.priceMin.toFixed(2)} – $${product.priceMax.toFixed(2)}`;

  return `
    <div class="qs-product-card">
      ${product.imageUrl ? `<img class="qs-product-image" src="${escapeAttr(product.imageUrl)}" alt="${escapeAttr(product.title)}" loading="lazy">` : '<div class="qs-product-image-placeholder"></div>'}
      <div class="qs-product-info">
        <p class="qs-product-title">${escapeHtml(product.title)}</p>
        <p class="qs-product-price">${price}</p>
        <a href="/products/${escapeAttr(product.handle)}" class="qs-product-cta" style="background:${primaryColor}">${escapeHtml(ctaText)}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  `;
}
```

---

## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] `selectResultPage()` always returns a result (fallback to first page)
- [ ] Score-based and tag-based matching work independently and combined
- [ ] `createDefaultResultPage()` called after every new quiz creation
- [ ] Admin editor scoped to `quiz.shop === session.shop`
- [ ] Position recompaction after result page deletion
- [ ] Storefront rendering escapes all user-controlled strings (XSS prevention)
- [ ] Layout variants: grid, list, carousel all implemented
- [ ] Product limit enforced (never return more than productLimit)
- [ ] `npm run typecheck` passes

---

## NEVER

- Never return zero result pages — always create a default one
- Never render unescaped product titles/descriptions in HTML
- Never expose admin-only data (shop field) in public API responses
- Never delete the last result page without warning
- Never skip fallback product matching — always show something

