name: scoring-engine
description: Use when implementing quiz scoring algorithms, point accumulation, weighted scoring, personality type scoring, score-to-result mapping, or multi-dimensional scoring. Triggered by: scoring algorithm, point system, score quiz, tally answers, weighted answers, personality score, score range, accumulate score, quiz scoring, score calculation
model: sonnet
