// Store the response
await db.quizResponse.create({
  data: {
    quizId: quiz.id,
    shop,
    sessionId,
    answers: JSON.stringify(rawAnswers),
    tags: JSON.stringify(scored.tags),
    score: scored.totalScore,
    personalityType: scored.personalityType,
    resultPageId: resultMatch?.resultPage?.id ?? null,
    completedAt: new Date(),
  },
});
```

---

## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] `totalScore` never negative (clamped to 0)
- [ ] Tags deduplicated and lowercased before returning
- [ ] Multi-choice answers (comma-separated IDs) handled correctly
- [ ] Question weight defaults to 1 when not set
- [ ] `scoreQuizResponse()` reads from DB — never takes answers at face value
