    prefix: "QUIZ",
  });
  // Include in response
  return Response.json({ ...resultData, discountCode }, { headers: corsHeaders });
}
```

---

## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] Discount codes generated server-side only — never client-side
- [ ] Percentage value passed as 0-1 (e.g., 10% = 0.10) to Shopify GraphQL
- [ ] `userErrors` checked after every mutation
- [ ] Discount codes are single-use by default (usageLimit: 1)
- [ ] Discount feature gated behind Pro/Enterprise plan
- [ ] Generated codes avoid ambiguous characters (0/O, 1/I)
- [ ] `npm run typecheck` passes

---

## NEVER

- Never generate discount codes on the client side
- Never hardcode discount values — make them configurable per quiz
- Never create unlimited-use codes by accident (always set usageLimit)
- Never expose Admin API key to the storefront widget

