## Cleanup: Expired Discount Codes

Periodically clean up expired unused discount codes to avoid cluttering the merchant's Shopify admin:

```typescript
const DELETE_DISCOUNT = `
  mutation discountCodeDelete($id: ID!) {
    discountCodeDelete(id: $id) {
      deletedCodeDiscountId
      userErrors { field message }
    }
  }
`;

// Run daily: find discounts created > 7 days ago with 0 usage, delete them
```

## Validation Checklist

- [ ] Plan gating checked before any discount creation (Pro+ only)
- [ ] Discount codes are cryptographically random — not sequential or guessable
- [ ] One-time-use codes have `usageLimit: 1` set in Shopify
- [ ] Expiration dates are set in UTC and account for timezone display on result page
- [ ] Discount codes are stored in QuizResponse record for attribution tracking
- [ ] Auto-apply to cart only fires when products are actually in the cart
- [ ] Minimum purchase amount uses the shop's currency (not hardcoded USD)
- [ ] Error handling for Shopify API rate limits and transient failures
- [ ] Discount title in Shopify admin clearly identifies it as QuizSnap-generated
- [ ] Unused expired codes are cleaned up to keep the merchant's discount list tidy

