- [ ] All tests mock `db.server` — never hit real database
- [ ] Tests cover happy path + edge cases (empty, invalid, boundary)
- [ ] Scoring tests verify mathematical correctness
- [ ] Billing tests verify plan gate enforcement
- [ ] `npm run test` shows 0 failures
- [ ] Test file names match service file names (`scoring.test.ts` for `scoring.server.ts`)

---

## NEVER

- Never write tests that hit real database or external APIs
- Never write tests that only test Prisma (that's testing the library)
- Never skip edge case testing (empty arrays, zero values, undefined)
- Never mock the actual business logic being tested

