```

## Collaboration Protocol

- **ui-specialist**: Product card settings in admin use Polaris Select/ChoiceList for layout config
- **responsive-builder**: Product grid breakpoints must match overall quiz responsive strategy
- **preview-builder**: Product cards render in results page preview
- **progress-bar-builder**: Results page shows 100% progress — coordinate final state

## Validation Checklist

- [ ] Prices formatted with `Intl.NumberFormat` — never hardcode `$` symbol
- [ ] Compare-at price shown with strikethrough only when higher than current price
- [ ] Sold out products show overlay and disabled button — never hidden entirely
- [ ] Variant selector updates price and image when variant changes
- [ ] Add to cart handles loading, success, and error states
- [ ] Product images use `loading="lazy"` and Shopify CDN width param
- [ ] Grid is responsive: 2 cols mobile, 3 cols tablet, 4 cols desktop
- [ ] Match score badge only shown when configured by merchant
- [ ] All cart API calls handle network errors gracefully
- [ ] "Add All to Cart" button available as optional feature

