description: Use when building quiz popup triggers, overlay containers, slide-in panels, exit-intent triggers, scroll triggers, timer-based popups, frequency capping, or mobile-friendly quiz launch mechanisms. Triggered by: popup, quiz popup, exit intent, scroll trigger, timer popup, slide in panel, overlay, popup trigger, frequency cap
