## POPUP CSS

```css
/* extensions/quiz-widget/assets/popup.css */

.qs-popup-overlay {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  z-index: 999999;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  animation: qs-fade-in 0.2s ease;
}

.qs-popup-overlay.qs-popup-closing {
  animation: qs-fade-out 0.3s ease forwards;
}

