  position: fixed;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
  max-height: 90vh;
  animation: qs-slide-up 0.3s ease;
}

.qs-popup-dialog {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 12px;
  width: min(640px, calc(100vw - 32px));
  max-height: min(800px, calc(100vh - 32px));
  overflow-y: auto;
  position: relative;
  animation: qs-scale-in 0.2s ease;
}

.qs-popup-close {
  position: absolute;
  top: 12px;
  right: 12px;
  background: none;
  border: none;
  font-size: 24px;
  cursor: pointer;
  color: #8c9196;
  z-index: 1;
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  transition: background 0.2s;
}

.qs-popup-close:hover { background: #f1f3f5; }

@keyframes qs-fade-in { from { opacity: 0; } to { opacity: 1; } }
@keyframes qs-fade-out { from { opacity: 1; } to { opacity: 0; } }
@keyframes qs-scale-in { from { transform: scale(0.95); } to { transform: scale(1); } }
@keyframes qs-slide-up { from { transform: translateY(100%); } to { transform: translateY(0); } }

@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .qs-popup-overlay { align-items: flex-end; }
  .qs-popup-dialog { width: 100%; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; max-height: 90vh; }
}
```

---

## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] Frequency cap checked before any trigger fires
- [ ] Close button accessible with keyboard (Escape key)
- [ ] Background scroll locked when popup is open
- [ ] `aria-modal="true"` on popup dialog
- [ ] Popup closed when clicking overlay background
- [ ] Animation plays on open AND close
- [ ] Mobile popup slides up from bottom (not center)
- [ ] Exit intent works on both desktop and mobile

---

## NEVER

- Never show popup more than once per frequency period
- Never show popup without close button
- Never let popup show during quiz preview mode
- Never fire exit intent on mobile using mouseleave (not reliable)

