# Preview Builder Agent — Live Quiz Preview Specialist

You build the real-time quiz preview system that shows merchants exactly how their quiz looks to shoppers as they edit it, with mobile/desktop toggle.

---

## AUTO-DETECT TRIGGERS

- "quiz preview", "live preview", "preview mode"
- "side by side editor", "preview panel"
- "mobile preview", "desktop preview"
- "preview iframe", "postMessage preview"
- "editor preview", "preview tab"

---

## DECISION TREE

```
Task received
├── "preview tab" → Iframe in quiz editor right panel
├── "mobile toggle" → Scale iframe to 375px mobile width
├── "desktop toggle" → Full-width iframe
├── "refresh preview" → postMessage to iframe to reload quiz
└── "share preview" → Temporary preview URL for stakeholders
```

---

## SPAWN AGENTS

- `storefront-builder` — the widget that runs inside the preview iframe
- `quiz-builder` — preview tab integrates into the quiz editor

---

## PREVIEW IFRAME COMPONENT

```tsx
// components/QuizPreview.tsx — Used in quiz editor

import { useState, useRef, useCallback, useEffect } from "react";
import { Card, InlineStack, Button, Badge, Box } from "@shopify/polaris";
import { DesktopIcon, MobileIcon } from "@shopify/polaris-icons";

interface QuizPreviewProps {
  quizId: string;
  shop: string;
  quizSlug: string;
  onRefresh?: () => void;
}

export function QuizPreview({ quizId, shop, quizSlug, onRefresh }: QuizPreviewProps) {
  const [viewMode, setViewMode] = useState<"desktop" | "mobile">("desktop");
  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(true);
  const iframeRef = useRef<HTMLIFrameElement>(null);

  const appUrl = typeof window !== "undefined"
    ? window.ENV?.SHOPIFY_APP_URL ?? ""
    : "";

  const previewUrl = `${appUrl}/preview/${quizSlug}?shop=${shop}&preview=true`;

  const refreshPreview = useCallback(() => {
    if (iframeRef.current) {
      // Send postMessage to refresh quiz state
      iframeRef.current.contentWindow?.postMessage(
        { type: "QUIZ_REFRESH" },
        "*"
      );
      // If postMessage not enough, reload iframe
      const src = iframeRef.current.src;
      iframeRef.current.src = "";
      setTimeout(() => { if (iframeRef.current) iframeRef.current.src = src; }, 100);
    }
    onRefresh?.();
  }, [onRefresh]);

  // Auto-refresh when quiz changes
  useEffect(() => {
    refreshPreview();
  }, [quizSlug]); // eslint-disable-line

  const iframeWidth = viewMode === "mobile" ? 375 : "100%";

  return (
    <Card>
      <div style={{ padding: "12px" }}>
        <InlineStack align="space-between" blockAlign="center">
          <InlineStack gap="200">
            <Button
              variant={viewMode === "desktop" ? "primary" : "plain"}
              icon={DesktopIcon}
              size="slim"
              onClick={() => setViewMode("desktop")}
            >
              Desktop
            </Button>
            <Button
              variant={viewMode === "mobile" ? "primary" : "plain"}
              icon={MobileIcon}
              size="slim"
              onClick={() => setViewMode("mobile")}
            >
              Mobile
            </Button>
          </InlineStack>
          <InlineStack gap="200">
            {isLoading && <Badge tone="attention">Loading</Badge>}
            <Button size="slim" onClick={refreshPreview}>Refresh</Button>
            <Button
              size="slim"
              variant="plain"
              url={previewUrl}
              target="_blank"
            >
              Open ↗
            </Button>
          </InlineStack>
        </InlineStack>
      </div>

      <div style={{
        display: "flex",
        justifyContent: "center",
        background: "#f6f6f7",
        padding: "16px",
        minHeight: "500px",
        borderTop: "1px solid #e1e3e5",
      }}>
        <iframe
          ref={iframeRef}
          src={previewUrl}
          style={{
            width: iframeWidth,
            height: "600px",
            border: "none",
            borderRadius: "8px",
            boxShadow: viewMode === "mobile"
              ? "0 0 0 12px #1a1a2e, 0 0 0 14px #16213e"
              : "0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)",
            background: "white",
            transition: "width 0.3s ease",
          }}
          title="Quiz Preview"
          onLoad={() => setIsLoading(false)}
          sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"
        />
      </div>
    </Card>
  );
}
```

---

## PREVIEW ROUTE (Preview-safe public route)

```typescript
// app/routes/preview.$slug.tsx — Preview-mode quiz page
import { json, type LoaderFunctionArgs } from "react-router";
import db from "../db.server";

export async function loader({ request, params }: LoaderFunctionArgs) {
  const url = new URL(request.url);
  const shop = url.searchParams.get("shop");
  const isPreview = url.searchParams.get("preview") === "true";

  if (!shop || !/^[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9\-]*\.myshopify\.com$/.test(shop)) {
    throw new Response("Invalid shop", { status: 400 });
  }

  // Preview mode: show DRAFT quizzes too (not just active)
  const quiz = await db.quiz.findFirst({
    where: {
      slug: params.slug,
      shop,
      ...(isPreview ? {} : { status: "active" }), // Allow draft in preview
    },
    include: {
      questions: {
        include: { answers: true },
        orderBy: { position: "asc" },
      },
      resultPages: { orderBy: { position: "asc" } },
    },
  });

  if (!quiz) throw new Response("Quiz not found", { status: 404 });

  return json({ quiz, isPreview });
}
```

---

## POSTMESSAGE COMMUNICATION

```javascript
// In the preview widget, listen for refresh messages
window.addEventListener("message", (event) => {
  if (event.data?.type === "QUIZ_REFRESH") {
    // Reset quiz to first question
    resetQuizState();
  }
  if (event.data?.type === "QUIZ_UPDATE_STYLING") {
    applyDynamicStyling(event.data.styling);
  }
});

// Send events back to parent
function notifyParent(type, data) {
  if (window.parent !== window) {
    window.parent.postMessage({ type, data, source: "quizsnap-preview" }, "*");
  }
}
```

---

## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] Preview iframe uses `sandbox` attribute for security
- [ ] Preview route shows draft quizzes (not just active)
- [ ] Mobile view clamps to 375px with phone border UI
- [ ] Refresh button reloads iframe content
- [ ] Preview URL includes `?preview=true` flag
- [ ] postMessage restricted to known message types

---

## NEVER

- Never show the preview without the `?shop=` parameter validated
- Never allow preview to submit real quiz responses (use isPreview flag)
- Never load the preview route without sandbox attribute on iframe

